Description: An end-to-end toolkit for turning raw electronic feeder or drinker logs into biologically meaningful metrics. Users submit visit-level feeding and drinking data, and the package automatically cleans the data; derives core variables such as meal length, intake, rate, and bout duration; generates other innovative features including exploratory and social behaviours, and environmental competitiveness. 
